{"w":2400,"h":3406,"lines":[{"h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.89484536239647394,"c":1,"w":0.063917522430419926,"t":"Test 4","y":0.040697674446472543},{"c":1,"x":0.063859784770191177,"w":0.76094518025716151,"y":0.083987029023801396,"h":0.017032850089663931,"t":"One American investigation into the potential for storing CO2 on agricultural lands is taking"},{"y":0.10029069783983924,"t":"place in California. Soil scientist Whendee Silver of the University of California, Berkeley, is","h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1,"x":0.063917514392924202,"w":0.76494847615559891},{"y":0.11584405161523248,"t":"conducting a first-of-its-kind study on a large caltle farm in the state. She and her students","c":1,"x":0.061799246988327165,"h":0.016645826876198422,"w":0.7629984537760417},{"w":0.039175256093343047,"y":0.1177325580380818,"c":1,"x":0.8639175264951382,"t":"Q37","h":0.013081395479068947},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"are testing the effects on carbon storage of the compost that is created from waste - both","y":0.1335877860354362,"x":0.061855679160860669,"c":1,"w":0.7587628682454427},{"y":0.14896852952384954,"w":0.73619059244791663,"c":1,"x":0.061800056898068001,"h":0.016780689192462228,"t":"agricultural, including manure and cornstalks, and waste produced in gardens, such as"},{"c":1,"t":"Q38","h":0.013081395479068947,"x":0.86597938133814756,"y":0.14825581372485508,"w":0.037113402684529562},{"w":0.32783505757649739,"c":1,"y":0.16559013482975105,"t":"leaves, branches, and lawn trimmings.","x":0.061855666971786384,"h":0.013211978860833806},{"y":0.18878440224599269,"w":0.73205469767252607,"t":"In Australia, soilecologist Christine Jones is testing another promising soil-enrichment","x":0.059754848688073042,"h":0.017469182129264627,"c":1},{"h":0.015988371754420694,"t":"strategy. Jones and 12 farmers are working to bulld up soil carbon by cultivating grasses.","x":0.061855667395772307,"y":0.2063953490030197,"w":0.75463918050130208,"c":1},{"x":0.863917526489411,"y":0.20494186036152562,"c":1,"t":"Q39","w":0.039175256093343158,"h":0.013081395479069058},{"t":"that stay green all year round. Like composting, the approach has already been proved","y":0.22225484446826305,"c":1,"x":0.061855677869273887,"w":0.73608245849609366,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"t":"experimentally; Jones now hopes to show that it can be applied on working farms and that","h":0.016393415660488575,"y":0.23660971366757644,"c":1,"x":0.063874908509964148,"w":0.76298517862955728},{"y":0.25425719326382279,"h":0.013211978860833917,"c":1,"x":0.063917537728544527,"w":0.48865976969401032,"t":"the resulting carbon capture can be accurately measured."},{"c":1,"x":0.065979375574032328,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.2776162790024268,"w":0.74020619710286462,"t":"It's hoped in the future that projects such as these will demonstrate the role that farmers"},{"c":1,"x":0.063847990896401446,"t":"and other land managers can play in reducing the harmful effects of greenhouse gases.","y":0.29154008213154381,"w":0.74036651611328119,"h":0.017195702159117698},{"w":0.75670104980468755,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"t":"For example, in countries like the United States, where most farming operations use large","x":0.06391751618507896,"y":0.30945390501410019},{"t":"applications of fertiliser, changing such long-standing habits will require a change of system. Q40","x":0.061487513499146003,"h":0.044248042215827788,"c":1,"y":0.31111983757141659,"w":0.84459671020507809},{"t":"Rattan Lal argues that farmers should receive paymentnot just for the corn or beef they.","x":0.061752110298716426,"y":0.3382436922221681,"w":0.75282831827799479,"h":0.020834588472519733,"c":1},{"x":0.059739971406587336,"h":0.015849237223617862,"c":1,"t":"produce, but also for the carbon they can store in their soil.","w":0.49911087036132812,"y":0.35631329960952773},{"y":0.38226658847187611,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"w":0.28865979512532547,"t":"Another study being carried out...","x":0.063917525004838494},{"h":0.022598654119252992,"c":1,"y":0.9542993804185137,"x":0.35215269185753062,"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.28952130635579432},{"x":0.90927835030192572,"h":0.013081395479069058,"t":"123","y":0.94476744175687455,"w":0.043298969268798837,"c":1}]}